# ── 19. FIRMS Aktivfeuer (thermal) — ACCEPTED ──
accepted https://firms.modaps.eosdis.nasa.gov/api/area/csv/{FIRMS_MAP_KEY}/VIIRS_SNPP_NRT/world/1
# title: FIRMS VIIRS SNPP Aktivfeuer (thermal) — globale Brände 24h
url https://firms.modaps.eosdis.nasa.gov/api/area/csv/{FIRMS_MAP_KEY}/VIIRS_SNPP_NRT/world/1
ttl 3600
force thermal
format csv
on earth 0 0 0
map .
lat latitude
lon longitude
field bright_ti4 biosphere_fire_brightness_ti4_k gaussian-inverse-square thermal K 3600 0.0 0.0
field frp biosphere_fire_radiative_power_mw gaussian-inverse-square thermal MW 3600 0.0 0.0
# Struktur (CSV, header): latitude,longitude,bright_ti4,scan,track,acq_date,acq_time,
# satellite,instrument,confidence,version,bright_ti5,frp,daynight. bright_ti4 = Helligkeitstemperatur
# Kanal I4 (K), frp = Fire Radiative Power (MW) — echte Wärmestrahlungs-Messung (IR), Litmus erfüllt
# (Wärmesinn). JSON-Variante (api/area/json/{key}/{source}/world/1) redirectet auf Earthdata-Login —
# CSV-Variante liefert Daten (format csv → csv_to_json → map). Probe 2026-08-15: Feuer bei
# lat=67.19506,lon=81.99062 (Sibirien), bright_ti4=341.95 K, frp=4.88 MW.

